<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Email Verification</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>Hello, <%= name %> 👋</h1>

    <p>Your email verification OTP is:</p>

    <h2><%= otp %></h2>

    <p>This OTP will expire in <strong>2 minutes</strong>.</p>

    <p>If you didn't request this verification, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
</body>
</html>